  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Bug Fixes\n\n- **fix(data):**  now orders by  instead of  (#199) — eliminates a race condition where two transactions committing within the same millisecond produced non-deterministic snap token results, making concurrent writes invisible to authorization checks (~20% flaky failure rate in parallel integration tests). Affects Postgres and SQL Server providers.\n- **fix(data/inmemory):**  concurrent writes now correctly track the maximum ULID rather than last-writer-wins, fixing the same race for in-memory tests.\n\n### CI / Infrastructure\n- Bump EnricoMi/publish-unit-test-result-action (#197)\n- Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (#198)",
